160
00:11:36,657 --> 00:11:39,617
After so much training, don't tell me that's all you've got!

161
00:11:40,157 --> 00:11:41,457
Not a chance!

162
00:11:45,797 --> 00:11:47,157
Enough of that!

163
00:11:48,037 --> 00:11:48,857
