164
00:11:50,177 --> 00:11:51,137
You're back!

165
00:11:51,137 --> 00:11:51,937
Hey!

166
00:11:51,937 --> 00:11:52,697
Get out of the way!

167
00:11:52,697 --> 00:11:53,237
Now!

168
00:11:53,357 --> 00:11:54,177
Move it!

169
00:11:54,177 --> 00:11:55,117
You'll die!

170
00:11:56,437 --> 00:11:56,897
Don't worry!

171
00:11:56,897 --> 00:11:59,737
I'll save you!

172
00:12:02,317 --> 00:12:18,557
There's no need to fight.

173
00:12:19,677 --> 00:12:23,297
I'm sure you both have your reasons, but you're friends, right?

174
00:12:23,717 --> 00:12:26,977
Wait! You mean Robin's been in the forest this entire time?

175
00:12:26,977 --> 00:12:33,297
Take this!

176
00:12:42,957 --> 00:12:47,557
Give it up already, alright? You guys don't stand a chance against us!

177
00:12:48,337 --> 00:12:49,477
Are you crazy?

178
00:12:50,557 --> 00:12:53,277
What, did you not see Boss Horty's broadcast before?

179
00:12:53,277 --> 00:12:55,037
This country's gonna burn.

180
00:12:55,037 --> 00:12:57,537
And Neptune is gonna die!

181
00:12:58,217 --> 00:12:59,337
Why, you!

182
00:12:59,617 --> 00:12:59,997
Stop!

183
00:13:01,657 --> 00:13:03,097
Spare them their lives.

184
00:13:03,617 --> 00:13:06,037
If you do not, you will be no better than they are.

185
00:13:06,637 --> 00:13:07,917
But, but, sir!

186
00:13:08,897 --> 00:13:11,457
Ryuboshi, Momboshi, take them into custody.

187
00:13:11,877 --> 00:13:13,397
Count on me, Redo!

188
00:13:13,777 --> 00:13:14,537
Say, Bill!

189
00:13:14,997 --> 00:13:19,057
I see you're as weak-willed as ever.

190
00:13:19,417 --> 00:13:24,057
But I guess that yellow belly of yours does run in the royal family, doesn't it?

191
00:13:24,057 --> 00:13:25,337
How dare you?

192
00:13:26,117 --> 00:13:28,337
It was reprehensible to harm humans.

193
00:13:28,757 --> 00:13:30,497
