194
00:13:31,277 --> 00:13:33,277
Does your heart not weep in regrets?

195
00:13:33,737 --> 00:13:39,437
Of course it doesn't, because any fish man who willingly sides with humans deserves nothing less than execution.

196
00:13:39,897 --> 00:13:42,637
